    "depth": 0,
    "payload": {
      "content": "The empty except clause is a sort of wildcard feature—because it catches everything, it\nallows your handlers to be as general or specific as you like. In some scenarios, this\nform may be more convenient than listing all possible exceptions in a try. For example,\nthe following catches everything without listing anything:"
